668		This formalization-only auxiliary isolates the complementary form of the
669		collision estimate in \cite[Fact~4.34]{Natarajan2018NEEXP}. Let $A$ and $B$ be
670		measurements with codeword outcome set $\Gamma$, let $\ket\psi$ be a unit
671		state, and let $\eps\geq 0$. If the evaluation map satisfies
672		\[
673			\Pr_{y}\big[\operatorname{eval}(g,y)
674				=\operatorname{eval}(g',y)\big]\leq\eps
675			\qquad(g\neq g'),
676		\]
677		then the off-diagonal overlap of $A$ and $B$ is at most the averaged
678		off-diagonal overlap of their evaluated measurements plus $\eps$.
