569	\paragraph{Formalization support for the sandwich estimate.}
570	The following subordinate results isolate the finite-distribution,
571	postprocessing, and operator-contraction steps used to formalize
572	\cite[Fact~4.34]{Natarajan2018NEEXP}. They are not named statements of either source paper.
573	
574	\begin{definition}[Formalization support for Lemma~\ref{lem:ld-sandwich}]
575		\label{def:sandwich-ordered-coordinate-product}
