577		\leanok
578		This formalization-only definition is the recursive form of the product in
579		\cite[Fact~4.34]{Natarajan2018NEEXP}. The empty product is $\Id$, the one-coordinate
580		product is $G^1_{g_1}$, and adjoining the last coordinate places its effect
581		on both sides of the preceding product.
582	\end{definition}
